 * Toont:
 *
 * - WordPress / PHP context
 * - combo parsing
 * - Search & Filter globals
 * - Query #1 state
 * - alle S&F fields
 * - DOM inputs
 * - browser URL
 * - LIVE events tijdens filteren
 *
